DESCRIPTION:Join us for a live Stryker Mako Robot demonstration featuring a fellow CCOM alumnus and orthopedic surgeon! Learn how robotic-assisted technology is used in orthopedic surgery\, see the system in action\, and get the chance to ask questions about both the technology and a career in orthopedics.\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=377629
DTSTART:20261015T220000Z
